WHAT THE WORK IS

The work is not the Python. It is the structure the Python enforces: the
encounter chain as integrated temporal causality rather than a borrowed clock;
the division between authored coherence edges and auto-written provenance
edges; the reference layer that bookmarks its sources rather than copying them;
the guarded write paths that keep the process layer closed to generic CRUD; the
temporal assembly of delivery; and the renewal economy that governs what is
said again. The code is the enforcement of that model. The model and its
enforcement are one work, and attribution covers both.

WHAT THE WORK DOES NOT INCLUDE

Kenning Encounter does not contain the layer that would make it anticipatory —
a graph neural network over the substrate's topology, turning accumulated recall
into prediction. Its absence is a decision, not a gap, and WITHHELD.md says so
in full and names it.

